# Windows crash-hunt route for the profile sign-on screen.
# Uses timed input only; combine with TS_PAD_TIME_SCALE=2 on the current Windows build.
# The later pulses type a single A, move to the lower command row, choose END, and confirm.
# Format: at seconds buttons lx ly rx ry
at 0 none 128 128 128 128
at 35 start 128 128 128 128
at 35.35 none 128 128 128 128
at 44 cross 128 128 128 128
at 44.35 none 128 128 128 128
at 56 cross 128 128 128 128
at 56.35 none 128 128 128 128
at 70 cross 128 128 128 128
at 70.35 none 128 128 128 128
at 78 cross 128 128 128 128
at 78.35 none 128 128 128 128
at 84 up 128 128 128 128
at 84.3 none 128 128 128 128
at 88 cross 128 128 128 128
at 88.3 none 128 128 128 128
# Sign-on rescue sequence. These timings intentionally begin after the profile
# keyboard is visible in current Windows runs.
at 92 cross 128 128 128 128
at 92.35 none 128 128 128 128
at 94 down 128 128 128 128
at 94.25 none 128 128 128 128
at 95 down 128 128 128 128
at 95.25 none 128 128 128 128
at 96 down 128 128 128 128
at 96.25 none 128 128 128 128
at 97 down 128 128 128 128
at 97.25 none 128 128 128 128
at 98 right 128 128 128 128
at 98.25 none 128 128 128 128
at 99 right 128 128 128 128
at 99.25 none 128 128 128 128
at 100 right 128 128 128 128
at 100.25 none 128 128 128 128
at 101 right 128 128 128 128
at 101.25 none 128 128 128 128
at 102 cross 128 128 128 128
at 102.5 none 128 128 128 128
at 108 cross 128 128 128 128
at 108.35 none 128 128 128 128
at 118 cross 128 128 128 128
at 118.35 none 128 128 128 128
at 130 cross 128 128 128 128
at 130.5 none 128 128 128 128
at 150 cross 128 128 128 128
at 150.5 none 128 128 128 128
at 175 cross 128 128 128 128
at 175.5 none 128 128 128 128
